WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.486
Every week, you work hard for your money.

00:00:02.486 --> 00:00:06.609
And every week, it seems to disappear before you can save any of it.

00:00:07.067 --> 00:00:09.120
MutualPool changes that.

00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:18.016
It's a savings pod for gig and trade workers, built on an idea communities have trusted for generations.

00:00:18.016 --> 00:00:23.148
You may know it as a tanda, a susu, a chama, or a chit fund.

00:00:23.598 --> 00:00:24.978
Here's how it works.

00:00:24.978 --> 00:00:28.909
You and your crew each put in the same amount every week.

00:00:28.909 --> 00:00:32.427
Twenty dollars, fifty, whatever your pod agrees on.

00:00:32.898 --> 00:00:35.988
Each week, one member receives the whole pot.

00:00:35.988 --> 00:00:42.099
The order is set when the pod locks, so everyone knows exactly when their turn is coming.

00:00:42.549 --> 00:00:43.401
No interest.

00:00:43.401 --> 00:00:44.536
No credit check.

00:00:44.536 --> 00:00:45.104
No loan.

00:00:45.104 --> 00:00:51.350
It's your own money, pooled with people you trust, paid out in full when it's your turn.

00:00:51.800 --> 00:01:00.588
Start a Trusted Circle with friends or your delivery crew, or join an Open Pod with verified members across the network.

00:01:00.588 --> 00:01:04.469
Your identity is verified, and so is everyone else's.

00:01:04.934 --> 00:01:08.866
Deposits come out of your MutualPool balance every Thursday.

00:01:08.866 --> 00:01:10.570
Payouts land every Friday.

00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:16.010
Fund your balance from your bank, or have your earnings deposited straight into it.

00:01:16.468 --> 00:01:19.843
The fees are simple and there are no surprises.

00:01:19.843 --> 00:01:25.660
Ten percent on each payout, and three of that goes to the member hosting the pod.

00:01:25.660 --> 00:01:33.991
Five percent of each deposit goes into your pod's own safety buffer, and if it's never needed, it comes back to you.

00:01:33.991 --> 00:01:34.709
That's it.

00:01:35.159 --> 00:01:42.567
If someone misses a deposit, the whole pod knows right away, and the rules protect the people who keep paying.

00:01:42.567 --> 00:01:45.530
Your pod decides together what happens next.

00:01:45.993 --> 00:01:55.028
Beyond saving, MutualPool brings you road perks from partners who get gig life: meals, repairs, phone plans, and more.

00:01:55.028 --> 00:01:59.315
Benefits that are not provided by your current employer.

00:01:59.793 --> 00:02:04.154
And brand campaigns that pay you for the miles you already drive.

00:02:04.154 --> 00:02:09.722
Yes, we partnered with local businesses to sponsor you as you make your deliveries.

00:02:09.722 --> 00:02:14.552
Wear hoodies or shirt with their message on it, and get paid by the day.

00:02:15.027 --> 00:02:16.307
Have a question?

00:02:16.307 --> 00:02:19.668
Ask Lainie, your built-in guide, any time.

00:02:20.118 --> 00:02:21.380
Pool together.

00:02:21.380 --> 00:02:22.642
Grow together.

00:02:22.642 --> 00:02:24.175
Deliver together.

00:02:24.175 --> 00:02:25.798
That's MutualPool.
